        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A short, poignant story-driven experience.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Niluas, an android who suddenly activated 276 years after the extinction of humanity, had somehow lost her memory.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Together with Naive, her integrated support AI, she sets out to explore her lost memories,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>the mystery of her activation, and the mystery of humanity's extinction.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While battling mysterious figures who suddenly appear and attacking androids, what truth will she uncover?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[What kind of game?]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world after humanity' extinction and uncover the truth behind lost memories and the fall of mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an <u><strong>exploration-focused adventure game with light RPG elements.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanied by the support AI Naive, you'll search for the truth while battling mysterious entities that suddenly appear and androids that attack you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/b4bf9e217a7de3c8c1ee3719e2106444.avif?t=1767844305\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read through the <u><strong>story</strong></u> while using <u><strong>commands</strong></u> to investigate and explore the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Battles</strong></u> unfold seamlessly as part of the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[System]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's viewpoint is that of the support AI, Naive. Issue commands to Niluas and advance the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The narrative, composed of 5 chapters, features a <strong><u>multi-ending system with Endings A, B, and C</u></strong>, changing the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, a side story unlocks after full completion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Exploration &amp; Battle]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely move across the field to solve mysteries and tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By exploring, you may find rare items or hints to solve the mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/7b8f1115a3a834ad942f24e95c4fb546.poster.avif?t=1767844305\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/7b8f1115a3a834ad942f24e95c4fb546.webm?t=1767844305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/7b8f1115a3a834ad942f24e95c4fb546.mp4?t=1767844305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moving around triggers random encounter battles with enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize skills and more to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/fd8a12e7970a4f7375ac8f723f030982.avif?t=1767844305\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, you'll experience story-driven battles where battle commands change according to enemy characteristics,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or Niluas might hide behind objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Voice Actors]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character voices are provided by a luxurious lineup of VAs: <u><strong>Reina Shiratori</strong></u> as the protagonist android, Niluas, and <u><strong>Saki Asagi</strong></u> as the mysterious being, Unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Please note that it features partially voiced rather than full voice acting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Characters]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/e87ae14cb37169865e5fddc6f409fccc.avif?t=1767844305\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras_big/e87ae14cb37169865e5fddc6f409fccc.avif?t=1767844305 width=1600 height=790 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/1fd735c2f1963c905e6e59f3259f101b.avif?t=1767844305\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras_big/1fd735c2f1963c905e6e59f3259f101b.avif?t=1767844305 width=1600 height=790 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/3f2ca7f2cdfa883fe384740e11630ced.avif?t=1767844305\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras_big/3f2ca7f2cdfa883fe384740e11630ced.avif?t=1767844305 width=1600 height=790 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/dc1a0be99202366202d5f1040d117c3a.avif?t=1767844305\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras_big/dc1a0be99202366202d5f1040d117c3a.avif?t=1767844305 width=1600 height=790 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Planning and Development]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Moko App.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Music]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >魔王魂(maou-damashii)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong># Confidential Document A10277</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Command]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the guidance of a support AI, players utilize commands to solve mysteries and unravel tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Combat]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When moving between locations, players may encounter enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the player's level is lower than the enemy's, they will be subjected to a preemptive attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must engage in combat using normal attacks and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Skills]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Usable skills in combat include the Gravity Cannon and Repair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are powerful, but require &quot;Skill Disks&quot; to activate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Skill Disks&quot; are not easily obtained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also skills that don't require Skill Disks but they are difficult to handle, so its sealed them away</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Level]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can level up by achieving victories in combat against enemies, based on the number of enemies defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The benefit of leveling up is an increase in HP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the player's level is higher than the enemy's, they can launch a preemptive attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Equipment]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Androids do not require traditional equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a modification chip is found, it is automatically installed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modification chips are rare and difficult to obtain, but they might be lying around somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Androids]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Androids are sentient mechanical lifeforms with self-awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are bipedal and designed to resemble humans.</p>",
